    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hunters Estate Agent is proud to present to the market this two bedroom ground floor apartment extending to 86 sq.m/926 sq.ft.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first/second time buyers, people downsizing and investors alike and is ideally located in the popular Seabury development just off Sydney Parade.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly consists of a kitchen, which is a practical and well-equipped space with parquet flooring and a range of wall and base kitchen units. The living/dining room is a long and spacious area which provides an excellent setting for both relaxing and entertaining. A particular feature of the living/dining room is the enclosed balcony, which overlooks the communal internal gardens.\r\n\r\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms within the property, and main bedroom is further complimented by an ensuite.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a fully tiled shower room offering a bright and practical space for everyday use.\r\n\r\nOverall, the property offers well-proportioned accommodation, generous storage and a combination of traditional features and practical modern conveniences, with the enclosed balcony overlooking the communal gardens providing an attractive additional feature\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys one of Dublin's most convenient and popular locations having all of Sandymount's many amenities within walking distance. Sandymount Village, Ballsbridge and Merrion Shopping Centre along with their vast array of coffee shops, restaurants and boutiques are all within easy reach. Some of Dublin's premier schools including St. Michaels, Muckross Park, Teresians and Blackrock College to name but a few are all easily accessible. \r\n\r\nPublic transport is well catered for with Lansdowne Road DART station being within a short stroll. The property is also just a short drive from some of Dublin's principle places of business such as Fitzwilliam Square, Merrion Square, Baggot Street and the I.T hub at Grand Canal Dock. Numerous sports grounds are also close by including the RDS, Merrion and Pembroke Cricket Clubs and Lansdowne Football Club."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALLWAY\r\n3.53m x 1.44m\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway featuring ceiling spotlights, attractive parquet flooring and an intercom phone. Convenient storage cupboards and a cloakroom area provide excellent additional storage as you enter the property.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n4.48m x 2.33m\r\nParquet flooring. Features a range of wall and base kitchen units, stainless steel sink, has a freestanding oven and hob with extractor hood, freestanding dishwasher and washing machine. The hot press is housed in a storage cupboard here too. \r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM\r\n2.04m x 1.73m\r\nW.C., wash-hand basin and shower cubicle and it's fully tiled. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\n2.81m x 3.33m\r\nParquet flooring and built-in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n2.83m x 4.94m\r\nStorage wardrobes. \r\n\r\nENSUITE\r\n2.03m x 1.35m\r\nW.C., and wash-hand basin. \r\n\r\nLIVING/DINING ROOM\r\n7.70m x 3.90m\r\nA long and spacious living/dining room featuring attractive ceiling cornicing, a brick fireplace with coal-effect gas fire inset, and recessed ceiling lighting. Wood panelling adds character and warmth to the room, while a dedicated T.V. point provides for modern living. The room also benefits from an enclosed balcony measuring 3.03m x 1.47m, overlooking the attractive communal internal gardens."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tTwo bedroom ground floor apartment\r\n•\tExtending to c. 86 sq.m /  926 sq.ft\r\n•\tAmple resident parking\r\n•\tMature well managed development\r\n•\tEnclosed balcony\r\n•\tExcellent location close to Sandymount village, Sydney Parade DART station and a host of amenities"
      },
